WEBVTT

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.080
Huh?

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.170
Wh-wh-wha...?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.330
Why is this happening to me?!

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.000
Goddess Dormitory

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.380
You're just pretending not to notice, aren't you?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:43.420
Mother of the Goddess' Dormitory

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.290
I can see the truth in your eyes

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.290
This isn't some sort of dramatic romance

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:49.920
My flushed body feels like it could melt

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.880
Honestly, I'm just being shy

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.830
Let me stir up feelings deep inside

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.580
I'll dress you in this outfit

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:01.540
See? My heart races for nobody but you

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:07.000
It is what it is, take it as it comes, just go with the flow

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
If you peer through the other side of the glass

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.420
You'll see a world of charming sweeties

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:18.880
Face to face, hold me in your arms, squeeze me tight

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:21.830
I want you so close to my side that

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.210
I can feel your pulse

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.540
Ooey-gooey love

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:30.830
My feelings for you get jumbled up by naughty love

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.380
Ooey-gooey love

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:37.130
Whatever you want, do as you like, I don't mind

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.830
Tracing my fingers along your skin

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.250
I'll show you a syrupy-sweet dream

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.920
When I stare at your lips

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:49.080
I wanna kiss you more and more

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.170
One day, my house caught on fire.

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.920
And instead of taking responsibility,
my dad skipped town.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:11.000
This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, organizations, laws, etc.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:11.000
are products of the author's imagination or used fictitiously.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:09.670
I, Koushi Nagumo, at the age of twelve,

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.960
began roaming the streets as a lone wolf...

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:17.790
Correction: I was dying in the gutter.

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:19.750
Food...

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:22.630
Please... I need food...

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:30.790
I get horrible diarrhea when I eat
scraps off the ground...

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.210
God, I'm so hungry...

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.670
Scavenging for food is a dangerous game.

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.170
Some foods spoil more quickly than others.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:46.380
Be careful of the omelettes in those
pre-packaged meals.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.250
So, whaddya wanna eat?

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.210
I'd like to know for future reference.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.540
Y'see, I'm a researcher.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:56.670
Pa...

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:58.750
Panties...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.170
P-panties?!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:06.330
Episode 1

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:06.330
Koushi Becomes a Dorm Mother

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.790
Yum, that hit the spot!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.920
Glad to hear it. We're fresh outta panties, though.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.460
Uh, no... That wasn't what I...

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.880
Now that I get a good look atcha, you're filthy.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.540
Feel free to use our bath.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.630
Seriously?!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.580
Sure. Just look-

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:25.540
There's a fish cake stuck to your cheek.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.880
I-I'll go take a bath now!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:36.210
Fill me in on the details when you're done, 'kay?

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.040
That caught me off guard...!

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:42.750
But, uh... What exactly is this place?

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.880
Goddess Dormitory Rules

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.500
Bath

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.920
It's gotta be that lady's house, right?

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.920
But it's way too big...

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.040
Whatever.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.880
Time for a nice, hot bath!

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.500
Huh?!

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.420
Wh-wh-wha...?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.380
Who let a kid in here?

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.540
A peeping Tom?

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.880
What a cute little elephant.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.040
What was that noise...?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.830
Oh well.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.540
Goddess Dormitory

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.330
There's already someone in the bath.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:38.710
I swear... Do those girls ever attend their lectures?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.290
Welcome home, Atena.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.830
Oh, Mineru.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.000
Who's in the bathroom right n-

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.040
Ow-ow-ow...

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.170
Wait, what's this white thing...?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.880
It's so soft...

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.170
Oopsie, were you three in the bath?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.130
Nice technique!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.920
Kids these days sure are ballsy.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.540
S-s-s-s-s-sorry!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.380
You're under arrest, kiddo.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:45.040
For the crimes of voyeurism, molestation,
and indecent exposure.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.380
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.500
It was an accident! An accident, I swear!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.250
Suuure it was.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.790
Listen, about the bath...

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.580
Save the excuses for later.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:58.540
Atena's in trouble.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.500
Huh?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.460
A-a boy...

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.250
touched my...

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:18.000
Men

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.830
Can't handle... men...

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.290
ARE YOU OKAY?!

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.210
We haven't introduced ourselves.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.670
This is the Goddess Dormitory
at Seikan Women's University.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:26.540
I'm the interim dorm mother, Mineru Wachi.

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.130
I'm a fourth-year in college.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:31.170
Koushi Nagumo.
First-year in middle school.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.710
And those lecherous women over there-

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:35.380
Hey, that's not very nice.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.580
The name's Kiriya Sensho. Second-year.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.920
I'm Frey, a third-year.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.750
Ah. That's my online handle, by the way.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.500
Serene Hozumi.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.750
I don't remember how long I've been here.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.830
Um... I'm sorry about earlier.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.670
Eh, water under the bridge.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.080
Mineru invited you here, right?

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.830
How do you know each other?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.420
Oh, I almost forgot. Gimme the scoop!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.960
Well, y'see...

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.540
So what you're saying is...

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:09.790
...you have no money, no family, and nowhere to stay.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.580
What a terrible situation...

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:16.380
That's why I have to find a job.

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:19.420
And I want to go to school, too.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.130
But...

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.170
...you can't do that without a place to stay.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.080
Y-yeah...

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.880
Well, if it sounds alright to you...

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.420
Why don't you work here? As our dorm mother.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.670
Dorm mother...?

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.040
Yup! We don't have one right now.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.670
Includes room and board.
Monthly salary, paid in cash.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:44.210
No qualifications required.
Inexperienced applicants are welcome.

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.290
And best of all, there's no age restriction.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.290
Well?

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:51.290
I-I'll take it! Please let me work here!

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.380
Perfect!

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.250
There's just one problem...

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.130
We have to convince her.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:56.960
Yeah...

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.670
Saotome

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.290
Atena? Do you have a minute?

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.130
Hey there! This boy's name is Koushi.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.290
I'm thinking of hiring him as our dorm mother.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.420
Y'see, his house burned down in a fire-

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.330
Nope.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.380
Aw, c'mon. Don't say that!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:17.710
No way.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.290
A boy, as our dorm mother? Not a chance!

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:21.540
No way.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.880
It was nice staying here while it lasted, I suppose.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:26.790
Goodbye.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.250
I had a feeling she would say no...

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.710
Uh, what's her deal...?

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.040
That's Atena. She's a first-year.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.880
She recently moved here from another dorm.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.210
Her family is mostly women.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:43.290
She had a sheltered childhood,
and she went to an all-girls high school.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:47.250
Her last dorm had a problem with girls
bringing their boyfriends home.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.210
She walked in on her roommate one day...

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:52.500
Blood came gushing out of her nose,
and she passed out.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.580
Just goes to show how uncomfortable
she is around men.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.290
Then why'd you hire me?!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:01.630
I figured that it'd be a win-win situation.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.460
In what way?!

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:07.540
Having to deal with those nosebleeds every time
that she bumps into a guy must get annoying.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:11.040
If you were to live here,
she might get used to being around men.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.130
Sure, but you scared her off.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.830
Yeah. What do we do?

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.290
This was unexpected...

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.630
In the meantime, shall we unpack your stuff?

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:19.670
No!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.330
Taking away someone else's home...

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.790
I absolutely refuse to do that!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.880
Please wait, Miss Atena!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.420
Wha-?! Wait!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.080
Come back!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.290
Don't run away!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.790
I'm not...!

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.250
I'm not running away.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.670
Ever since my last dorm...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.790
I'm just protecting myself, that's all.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:04.880
And that's fine. You're well within your rights.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.130
I turned down Miss Mineru's offer.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.170
So please relax and go back to the dorm.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.630
That's your home, not mine.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:21.330
Not having a place where you
can unwind would be tough.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:32.000
Not having a place where you
can unwind would be tough.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:36.420
Y'see, his house burned down in a fire...

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.460
Oh yeah... She did say that.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:42.040
And yet, he...

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.670
Koushi was willing to protect me, but I...

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.040
I was totally selfish.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.130
I was only looking out for myself.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.710
ACHOO!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.380
Ugh, the exhaustion's setting in...

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:04.750
No, stay awake!

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.540
If I fall asleep here, I might not ever wake up.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:12.830
But I'm glad that... it's not Miss Atena...

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:18.000
...who has to... go through this...

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:25.750
Dummy.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.920
How am I supposed to leave you
out here after hearing that...?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:36.670
Huh?

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.790
What's going on...?

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:42.540
I feel... safe.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:46.580
It's warm, and it smells nice...

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.000
And it's soft-

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.380
W-wait... I just, uh...

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.790
On second thought...

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.960
I can't handle... MEN!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:07.540
MISS ATENA!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.330
Welcome home.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.380
Th-thanks.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.290
You went through a lot, huh?

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.000
And yet... you made it back in one piece.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.500
Nice job, kiddo!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.630
I think that Miss Atena tried really hard
to face her fears.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.210
I don't want to disappoint her.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:36.210
So I'll do my best to be a good dorm mother!

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.540
Do you think she'll forgive me?

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.500
She went out of her way to find you, didn't she?

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.170
That says it all, don't you think?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.250
Yup.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:50.170
Let's be good friends, Mr. Dorm Mother.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.540
Yeah!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.000
Mother of the Goddess' Dormitory

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.670
It's gotta be you

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.420
It's gotta be you

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.000
It's gotta be you

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.170
I'm sure of it, but...

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:12.830
I can't admit it

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.580
I'll never admit it

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.170
And the truth is

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.330
I wanna tell you

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:21.420
You're still just like a child

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:25.040
Blind to everything around you

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:28.330
Those nonchalant actions of yours

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:31.790
Make my heart skip a beat

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.830
Why do I think

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.630
Of someone like her

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.460
As a rival?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.130
It's bizzare

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.710
The longer that I live with you

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:48.540
The more that everyone seems to change

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:52.210
Hey! I love your bashful side

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:54.000
And your serious side, too

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.250
I always, always want you by my side

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.290
Aah! This position that I'm in

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:00.960
I don't wanna give it up

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.750
I wanna profess my love!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:06.080
Our hectic daily life together

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:09.080
I wish it could go on forever

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:09.670
It's like

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:10.290
When you're here

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:11.040
When you're here

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:11.790
Next to me

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.630
I can't help but blush

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.920
It's gotta be you

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.580
It's gotta be you

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.330
It's gotta be you

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.500
I'm sure of it, but...

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.130
I can't admit it

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.920
I'll never admit it

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.500
And the truth is

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.080
I wanna tell you, but...

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:33.040
The Problem with Mineru and Frey

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.040
Isn't that the place?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:41.880
Huh?

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.380
The problem dorm that everyone talks about.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.670
Hey, look! There's someone outside!

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:50.000
"Problem dorm"...?

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.580
No, don't get hung up on that.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.880
It doesn't matter what kind of
reputation this place has.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:15:00.330
Thanks to Mineru and the others,
I landed a job and a safe place to live.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:04.630
If I'm gonna repay them for their kindness,
I gotta work my butt off as their dorm mother!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.670
Yikes, is that the problem dorm?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:07.790
Sure is.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.670
I could never live in a place like that.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.290
Same here.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:10.790
'Kay, let's get down to business!
Same here.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.420
'Kay, let's get down to business!

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.130
Hold on...

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:18.380
Compared to the first floor,
the second floor looks like a pigsty!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.130
The second floor is where all of the bedrooms are...

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.330
But why's it so dirty...?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:21.750
DANGER

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:21.750
Do not touch

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:28.420
The door to Miss Atena's room
is the only one that's clean.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:33.080
She's got makeup lessons on Saturdays,
and it's kinda lonely without her around...

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.960
But I'm the dorm mother. Cleaning is my job!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.290
C'mon, time for some housekeeping!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:39.170
Wachi

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.580
Huh? Is the doorbell broken?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.210
Miss Mineru?

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.380
Oh jeez, sorry!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:48.880
Koushi?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.580
M-Miss Mineru...

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.630
I-I'm going around to collect the garbage...

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.880
What's that...?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.670
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:59.130
D-did something bad happen...?

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.920
This is par for the course.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.710
And it's perfectly safe, I assure you.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.130
The garbage, right? Thanks a bunch.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.460
But there's no need to overwork yourself.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:11.170
It must be a handful.
Why not wait until the night before to-?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:13.080
Whoa, Miss Mineru!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:14.830
Is something wrong?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.830
Wh-why aren't you wearing any...?!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.130
My bad, kiddo. It's a habit of mine.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:24.580
I might've mentioned this before,
but I'm a researcher.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.580
Being naked is crucial to
making progress on my experiments.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.790
Fine! I get it, so please cover yourself up!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.580
It doesn't bother me in the slightest.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:36.170
Well, maybe it should! I'm begging you!

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:39.880
F-from now on, I'm going to
collect the garbage each morning.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.790
Please make sure that you're
wearing clothes when I show up!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.880
Gotcha! Later, kiddo.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.330
O-one room and I'm already exhausted...

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:55.380
They say that older women let it all hang out
when they're at home...

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.290
Is this what they meant...?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.580
I just have to get used to it, I guess...

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.330
Frey

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.960
Oh, my goodness!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.880
It suits you beautifully, Koushi!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:15.040
Uh, Miss Frey...
I'm supposed to be cleaning the second floor.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.830
There's no harm in having a little fun.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.750
Think of it as part of your dorm mother duties. Okay?

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.040
M-my duty? To wear these clothes...?

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.210
Sure.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.380
It's important to get to know
our residents firsthand, don't you think?

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.960
I happen to be an avid cosplayer.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.330
My costumes are all handmade.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.290
I love to wear them, and I love to dress people up.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.790
That's why I've spent ages searching for
a male model like you, Koushi!

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:39.750
When I spot someone with the perfect figure,

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:42.210
I swoop in and dress them up
in a costume that fits them.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:42.790
It doesn't matter whether they're a man or a woman!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.460
Help me!
It doesn't matter whether they're a man or a woman!

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:44.960
It doesn't matter whether they're a man or a woman!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.290
Tee-hee!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.000
That's how you get arrested.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:52.330
Don't worry. Nobody's watching us in here.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.710
A premeditated crime?!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.580
She's the complete opposite of Miss Atena,

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:59.710
but Miss Frey seems to have
a few issues of her own...

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:03.460
And since you're here, there's something
that I'd like your help with.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:05.880
A measuring tape?

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:09.540
Y'see, I don't think that I'm
the same size as I used to be...

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:12.750
...so I want to double check my measurements.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.130
M-Miss Frey?!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:18.710
Would you mind measuring
my bust, waist, and hips for me?

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:20.170
N-no way!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.540
But it's your job.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.920
Both the top and underside of my bust.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.330
Be sure to take measurements
from different angles.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:35.250
O-okay...

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:41.880
On second thought, please do this yourself!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.080
Was that on purpose?

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:56.170
Kids these days sure are assertive...

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.460
Alright, then.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:00.330
Allow me to teach you a lesson...

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.080
Evacuate the premises!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.670
Due to a failed experiment, toxic fumes have
begun to spread throughout the building!

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.210
Proceed to the nearest exit!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.000
T-toxic fumes?!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.750
Let's discuss the details outside!

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.460
H-hold on...

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.920
Should you be letting it evaporate
into the air like that?!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.920
It's no big deal. Besides, I haven't been sued yet.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.500
Where are the others?

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.880
Out of the house, it seems.

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.290
Luckily for them.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.380
How can you be so calm about this?!

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.210
This is par for the course.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:34.580
Mineru's known on campus as
the "Walking Toxic Fumes Generator."

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:37.080
And Frey is the "Walking Dress-up Demon."

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:39.920
So this what they meant by "problem"...

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:42.790
We'll have to wait until it subsides...

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.460
What should we do?

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.630
It's a little too cold to kill time outside...

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.710
Isn't there anything else that you want to say?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.540
Huh?

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.460
Those are toxic fumes.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.330
What if something bad had happened?!
What would you have done then?!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:59.380
But no one got hurt, and everything's fine.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.460
Stuff like this happens all the time.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:02.920
That's not the point!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.670
It doesn't matter if this happens all the time
or if you don't get sued.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:08.750
If there's a chance that you caused
an inconvenience to someone,

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:11.000
then you ought to reflect on your actions
and show some remorse!

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.960
Sorry.
I'm sorry.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.670
I-I'm not saying that you can't
do experiments anymore...

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:23.500
Um... I think that having hobbies is a good thing.

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:24.960
S-so...

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:28.540
PLEASE FORGIVE ME FOR YELLING AT YOU!

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:32.250
But we... aren't angry...

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.420
I really screwed up...

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.670
A freeloading bum like me has no right
to preach at them like that.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:43.040
They're older than me, they're women,
and I owe them my life.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.920
What a disaster...

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:49.500
Wearing these clothes out in public
is a total nightmare, too!

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.170
No pictures!

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.710
Please, not while I look like this!

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.710
I left behind a couple of people
in an even worse situation than mine...

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.750
To be totally honest...

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.920
Getting scolded like that was a nice change of pace.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.380
You're right.

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:10.170
Most kids would be afraid to yell at
someone older than them.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.210
It made me happy.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.500
You found a good one, Mineru.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:17.630
Yup.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.040
ACHOO!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.580
Miss Mineru! Miss Frey!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.790
Please use this blanket to
cover yourselves up for now.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.750
Where'd it come from?

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:37.040
I got it using a special skill that I learned
while living on the streets for a few days.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.330
That must've been rough...

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:43.170
N-not especially... I'm a guy, y'know?

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.000
I just wanted to do what
any decent guy would have done.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.330
And I figured that it was my job
as the dorm mother...

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:53.500
You are such a good kid!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:57.460
This place has garnered a reputation on campus
for being the "problem dorm,"

00:21:57.460 --> 00:22:00.630
and the residents who live here
are a bunch of misfits, but...

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:04.420
...I'd love to see "Koushi the Dorm Mother" in action,
so be patient with us, 'kay?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:07.460
O-okay...

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:09.960
Thanks a bunch, Mr. Dorm Mother!

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:12.710
Wh-wh-wh-wha...?!

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:16.750
WHAT THE HECK ARE YOU DOING?!

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:23.670
The Goddess Dormitory can't go on
like this any longer!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:26.920
This boy is a middle schooler.
We're in college!

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:28.880
If we're going to create
a wholesome living environment,

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:31.500
we ought to conduct ourselves
in an orderly fashion!

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:33.130
"Wholesome"?

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:34.460
"Orderly"?

00:22:34.460 --> 00:22:35.920
I don't fully understand...

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.630
I've always felt strongly about this.

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:42.000
It isn't appropriate for ladies to wander around
a dormitory in various states of undress!

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.040
Especially now that Koushi lives here.

00:22:44.040 --> 00:22:46.130
I won't allow you to corrupt his young mind!

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:47.790
So what do you wanna do?

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:49.630
I've made a decision.

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:52.750
From here on out, I'm going to
crack down on immoral behavior!

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:53.750
Uh-huh...

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:54.880
I mean it!

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:56.710
I get where you're coming from,

00:22:56.710 --> 00:22:59.330
but I feel most comfortable
when I'm not wearing clothes...

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:06.830
Atena... What are those?

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:08.960
I had a feeling that something
like this might happen,

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:11.210
so I went online and ordered these
as a secret weapon!

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:14.040
His name is Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:23:12.210 --> 00:23:14.460
Note: "Fuki mamoru" translates to "enforces moral standards."

00:23:16.210 --> 00:23:17.710
That looks kind of fun.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.460
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:21.380
Do me, next.

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:23.210
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:26.330
Mr. Fuki Mamoru! Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:34.960
Maybe I shouldn't laugh, but...
things aren't so bad around here.

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:39.380
I'm really glad that I ended up
at the Goddess Dormitory.

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:41.500
Save me!

00:23:42.920 --> 00:23:43.830
Cut it out!

00:23:51.920 --> 00:23:53.130
I can't decide...

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:54.920
What's the matter, Miss Atena?

00:23:54.920 --> 00:23:56.670
"Big Sis" is too boring.

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.080
"Big Sister"? "Sis"?

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:00.000
Uh...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.500
"Sista"? "Sister Dearest"? "Sissy"?

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:04.500
"Sissy"!

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:06.420
Wh-what are you doing...?

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:11.080
The Problem with Kiriya and Serene

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:11.080
Atena Awakens

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:09.290
It's. A. Secret!
